# Keep secrets, data and local clutter out of every Docker build context (SECURITY_FINDINGS INFRA-1).
.git
.github
.claude
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.production.example
backups
**/uploads
**/logs
**/*.log
**/coverage
frontend/.next
frontend/.next-dev
frontend/out
mobile
k8s
monitoring
docs
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
gitleaks-report.json
